    "result_text": "There is only one actual test class (`AcceptanceTest`); the other two are support classes. The full suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the tenure requirement for membership level 4 in `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/MembershipLevel.java`.\n\nChanges:\n- Raised the cap (`MAX_LEVEL`) from 3 to 4 and added a `TENURE_DAYS_FOR_LEVEL_4 = 365` constant.\n- `forOwner` now adds a fourth +1 factor when the owner's tenure \u2014 days between `registrationDate` and today \u2014 is **more than 365 days**, then caps at 4.\n- Added a null/future-safe `tenureExceedsLevel4Threshold` helper: a `null` or future `registrationDate` yields zero/negative tenure and never qualifies.\n\nBecause the controller sets a new owner's `registrationDate` to today, a brand-new owner has zero tenure and never earns the level-4 bonus \u2014 so a new owner with an email and `namesakeCount` of 0 lands at level 3, exactly as the spec and the `coreNewOwnerCappedAtLevel3` acceptance test require.\n\n`./mvnw test` \u2192 **BUILD SUCCESS**, `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`.",
